WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.830 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:31.880 --> 01:36.550
Ahh-~ Taking a walk after lunch
always hits the spot!

01:37.090 --> 01:39.240
It's cool, but refreshingly so.

01:39.240 --> 01:41.930
But I feel so cold!

01:41.930 --> 01:44.500
I feel so tired I want to hibernate...

01:44.500 --> 01:46.500
Pass it here!

01:46.500 --> 01:48.000
Go go go!

01:48.930 --> 01:50.290
Go, Jun!

01:52.670 --> 01:54.000
Okay, leave it to me!

01:57.540 --> 01:59.040
Way to go, Mimura!

01:59.040 --> 02:00.280
Awesome!

02:05.820 --> 02:10.620
I need to tap into
some of their energy.

02:10.620 --> 02:15.360
Chocolat-chan...
is Pierre still on your mind?

02:15.360 --> 02:18.830
Not at all! I've already
forgotten about Pierre!

02:18.830 --> 02:22.000
Hey, I think I'll see
if they'll let me play!

02:26.910 --> 02:29.120
Hey, hey! Let me play too!

02:29.570 --> 02:33.880
Ahh, Kato! Come join our
team! We're one short.

02:34.210 --> 02:35.610
'Kay, here it comes!

02:38.820 --> 02:39.930
Take it, Akira!

02:39.930 --> 02:40.850
Okay!

02:45.220 --> 02:45.960
Akira!

02:46.660 --> 02:48.090
Can't let you do that!

02:48.660 --> 02:49.590
Taiji!

02:52.120 --> 02:53.960
It's up to you...

02:57.300 --> 02:59.860
Akira, I won't let your
sacrifice go to waste.

03:00.610 --> 03:01.410
Kato!

03:02.440 --> 03:06.110
Kitajima! Nishitani! Cover Kato!

03:06.110 --> 03:06.850
Okay!

03:06.850 --> 03:07.620
Leave it to me!

03:07.620 --> 03:09.150
Nice pass, Taiji!

03:09.750 --> 03:11.750
Kato, it's all you now!

03:22.790 --> 03:23.660
GOOOAL!

03:23.660 --> 03:26.030
Good going, Kato! Nice shot!

03:26.030 --> 03:28.770
It's just too bad you're a girl.

03:28.770 --> 03:30.640
Them's the breaks...

03:30.640 --> 03:32.800
That was a nice shot there.

03:45.250 --> 03:47.380
Is something wrong, Kato?

03:47.890 --> 03:51.830
No, n-nothing!
Time for a water break!

03:56.700 --> 03:58.060
Chocolat-chan...

03:59.530 --> 04:03.070
A Friend's Heart, Precious Feelings.

04:06.870 --> 04:09.540
Why? What's wrong with me?

04:15.580 --> 04:19.780
My feelings for Pierre should've been
sealed away in that chocolate.

04:30.800 --> 04:35.430
But he can still make my heart beat
out of control by just talking to me.

04:36.700 --> 04:39.400
Oh, be still, my heart!

04:45.810 --> 04:47.610
Chocolat-chan, is something wrong?

04:48.250 --> 04:48.800
Like what?

04:48.800 --> 04:51.800
It's just... are things between
you and Pierre still...?

04:51.800 --> 04:56.750
Didn't I already tell you?
I don't see him that way anymore.

04:57.260 --> 05:00.580
He just caught me by surprise there,
and it threw me off-balance.

05:01.290 --> 05:06.060
Hey! Kato, let's continue what
we started at recess!

05:06.870 --> 05:09.630
Sorry, but I'm calling it a day. Later!

05:17.440 --> 05:19.910
What's wrong, Chocolat-chan?
Let's hurry home.

05:23.620 --> 05:24.920
Chocolat-chan?

05:25.420 --> 05:28.050
Sorry, Vanilla. You go on ahead.

05:31.460 --> 05:35.530
But we promised to go straight
home and make stew.

05:36.090 --> 05:39.660
I think Chocolat's got her head in the clouds!

05:39.660 --> 05:41.150
What do you mean, Blanca?

05:41.150 --> 05:44.240
Obviously, she still
has Pierre on her mind.

05:44.240 --> 05:47.270
She's in no state to collect hearts.

05:47.270 --> 05:51.140
You're sure to be the next Queen
now, Vanilla-chama!

05:51.910 --> 05:54.250
It won't be as easy as you think.

05:54.250 --> 05:59.960
You're Queen Candy's only daughter;
It's only natural that you be queen too!

06:00.320 --> 06:06.460
Just make Chocolat a palace guard so she
can spend the rest of her life serving you!

06:07.590 --> 06:09.990
If I become Queen...

06:14.500 --> 06:18.140
Chocolat, how long are ya
gonna stare into space?

06:19.140 --> 06:24.740
Hey, I'm freezin' here!
I can't stand the cold!

06:25.880 --> 06:29.110
I guess the Valentine
magic didn't work.

06:29.110 --> 06:30.980
Huh? What's that about?

06:30.980 --> 06:32.320
N-nothing at all!

06:32.320 --> 06:33.720
Huh, Kato?

06:33.720 --> 06:34.200
*ribbit*

06:34.590 --> 06:35.450
Mimura.

06:35.450 --> 06:36.990
What're you doing here?

06:36.990 --> 06:39.210
What about you, Mimura?

06:39.210 --> 06:43.210
Nothing much, I just wanted
to check on this guy.

06:45.260 --> 06:48.430
Ah, a snake! It's so cute!

06:48.430 --> 06:50.600
You're not scared of snakes?

06:50.600 --> 06:51.890
Not one bit!

06:51.890 --> 06:56.440
You're a strange one, all right.
Normal girls would be scared.

06:58.040 --> 07:02.650
It's winter and he's still
not hibernating. I bet he's cold.

07:03.420 --> 07:07.180
Hey, you okay with not hibernating?

07:08.390 --> 07:10.660
Don't let some little brat catch you!

07:10.660 --> 07:12.860
Aren't you a little brat?

07:12.860 --> 07:14.490
I'm not that bratty.

07:14.490 --> 07:16.190
You like snakes?

07:16.190 --> 07:17.400
Yeah, kinda.

07:17.400 --> 07:18.700
Well, what about frogs?

07:18.700 --> 07:20.100
I love them.

07:20.100 --> 07:21.100
Spiders?

07:21.100 --> 07:22.700
I really love them!

07:22.700 --> 07:24.500
Well, what about bats?

07:24.500 --> 07:25.770
I really REALLY love them!

07:25.770 --> 07:27.170
Then what about skeletons?

07:27.170 --> 07:29.720
Skeletons? Not so much...

07:29.720 --> 07:32.480
Oh, so you're just a scaredy-cat!

07:32.480 --> 07:33.750
I am not!

07:33.750 --> 07:34.680
Are too.

07:34.680 --> 07:35.850
Oh, am I?

07:37.220 --> 07:39.920
Being with Mimura is so much fun.

07:39.920 --> 07:43.220
With Pierre, it's just so painful.

07:45.260 --> 07:46.860
Is there something wrong?

07:46.860 --> 07:48.860
No, not really.

07:50.060 --> 07:53.030
Oh, yeah! Are you free tomorrow?

07:53.030 --> 07:55.410
If you are, I'll take you
someplace super fun!

07:56.000 --> 07:57.370
Someplace fun?

07:57.800 --> 08:02.340
There's this haunted house that's got
mega-realistic snakes and bats!

08:02.340 --> 08:03.420
Huh?

08:03.780 --> 08:07.510
It's in the amusement park! I haven't been
there lately, so let's go there together!

08:07.980 --> 08:09.250
Yeah, let's go!

08:10.350 --> 08:11.920
This tastes soooo good!

08:14.140 --> 08:17.860
Sorry for leaving you to make
dinner on your own, Vanilla,

08:17.860 --> 08:19.990
but it turned out great!

08:19.990 --> 08:22.490
Good to hear. Eat all you want.

08:22.490 --> 08:27.660
I'm gonna play with Mimura tomorrow,
so I'll need the energy.

08:28.570 --> 08:32.370
Speaking ol Mimura-kun,
you seem to get along very well with him.

08:32.370 --> 08:35.370
He usually doesn't play with girls.

08:35.370 --> 08:38.240
We aren't that different,

08:38.240 --> 08:41.050
'cause we both love things
like snakes and bats.

08:41.050 --> 08:42.310
Huh?

08:42.310 --> 08:43.720
Seconds please!

08:43.720 --> 08:45.320
Okay, okay.

08:45.880 --> 08:52.020
Now what to wear tomorrow?
It's gotta be easy to move in, but...

08:52.020 --> 08:53.390
Having fun, aren't we?

08:53.390 --> 08:56.220
Of course! I'm going to the
amusement park tomorrow!

09:00.130 --> 09:03.270
No way! Chocolat has a date
at the amusement park?!

09:03.270 --> 09:05.700
So it would seem.

09:05.700 --> 09:07.480
What's wrong, Waffle?

09:07.740 --> 09:11.190
Are you going on a date with Chocolat
at the amusement park, Houx-sama?!

09:11.190 --> 09:13.690
I didn't make any promise like that...

09:14.050 --> 09:15.750
I'm so relieved!

09:15.750 --> 09:18.700
So you don't have a date
with Chocolat tomorrow?

09:19.250 --> 09:22.850
Yeah, I caught a bit of a cold today,
so I need to get some rest.

09:24.120 --> 09:26.820
That puts my mind at ease.

09:26.820 --> 09:28.760
So how about a date with me?

09:29.290 --> 09:32.250
Like I said, I really
need to get some rest.

09:32.250 --> 09:34.770
You can't go no matter what?

09:34.770 --> 09:36.330
Sorry, Waffle.

09:36.330 --> 09:38.470
Understand now? Hurry on home.

09:38.470 --> 09:42.310
What if you make Houx's cold worse?

09:42.310 --> 09:46.080
Okay, then you take Houx-sama's
place and come with me, Saule!

09:46.080 --> 09:46.980
Say what!?

09:46.980 --> 09:51.350
Waffle-sama, that doesn't
seem very reasonable...

09:51.350 --> 09:55.990
So? I really wanna go to the
amusement park! I wanna, I wanna!

09:56.390 --> 10:00.160
Kids will be kids.
Go with her this once.

10:00.160 --> 10:01.530
I'll get you for this...

10:02.530 --> 10:03.990
So it's decided!

10:19.510 --> 10:22.410
Is that what you're wearing,
Chocolat-chan?

10:22.410 --> 10:23.980
Yeah. Anything wrong with it?

10:23.980 --> 10:29.750
Not really "wrong," just more suitable
for a battle than the amusement park.

10:29.750 --> 10:35.260
Well, we'll be facing snakes
and bats, so I need mobility.

10:35.260 --> 10:36.760
I'm off to "battle"!

10:37.500 --> 10:38.760
Have fun!

10:39.330 --> 10:41.630
Well, at least she's in a good mood.

10:41.630 --> 10:47.110
Even so, it's frustrating that Chocolat
went on a date and left you behind!

10:47.110 --> 10:52.330
It's not like it's a real date.
They're just friends.

10:52.330 --> 10:57.050
This is simply unacceptable! You must
captivate every man in the world!

10:57.050 --> 10:59.090
That is the essence of a Queen!

10:59.920 --> 11:02.120
Sounds like a pretty tall order.

11:06.100 --> 11:07.990
Yoohoo, Mimura!

11:09.360 --> 11:11.560
Now that's what I call fashion sense!

11:11.560 --> 11:14.860
It's only natural, if we're gonna
play like there's no tomorrow!

11:14.860 --> 11:16.070
Oh yeah!

11:16.070 --> 11:17.170
C'mon, let's go!

11:17.170 --> 11:18.640
Uh... Yeah...

11:19.770 --> 11:21.070
What's the matter?

11:21.070 --> 11:23.780
Actually, I'm worried about
that snake from yesterday.

11:23.780 --> 11:29.010
Since it's so cold today, I'm afraid he'll be
in trouble if he doesn't find a hiding spot.

11:29.010 --> 11:29.660
I see...

11:29.660 --> 11:31.680
Snake, where'd ya go?

11:31.680 --> 11:33.520
Snake, do you copy?

11:33.520 --> 11:36.250
I hope he didn't get caught
by any bad kids.

11:36.250 --> 11:39.520
I hope he didn't fall
into a pond and drown.

11:39.520 --> 11:40.010
Huh?!

11:42.930 --> 11:44.230
Ow! Ow!

11:46.470 --> 11:48.570
He had a hibernation hole all along.

11:48.570 --> 11:53.170
Yeah, that snake must've burrowed
underground from here.

11:53.170 --> 11:54.810
Now I can rest easy!

11:54.810 --> 11:55.770
Yeah!

11:55.770 --> 11:58.280
And now, time for
the amusement park!

11:58.280 --> 11:58.980
Yeah!

12:03.860 --> 12:05.650
Huh? Bikes?

12:05.650 --> 12:08.350
Yeah, the amusement park's
kinda far away,

12:08.350 --> 12:10.890
so I borrowed one for you to ride.

12:11.560 --> 12:14.930
This looks fun!  I've always
wanted to ride a bike!

12:14.930 --> 12:17.400
You've never ridden a bike before?

12:17.400 --> 12:18.500
Nope.

12:18.500 --> 12:19.900
You gonna be okay?

12:19.900 --> 12:21.400
Don't worry about me!

12:29.110 --> 12:30.610
See? I'm fine!

12:30.610 --> 12:33.110
Yeah, you're pretty good!

12:33.810 --> 12:35.210
Yahoo!

12:35.910 --> 12:37.910
Hey! Be careful!

12:39.600 --> 12:41.550
This feels so good!

13:19.820 --> 13:23.160
Okay... Time to take the lead!

13:23.160 --> 13:26.760
Hey! Wait up! Not so fast!

13:26.760 --> 13:27.530
Slowpoke!

13:27.530 --> 13:28.700
I said wait!

13:37.110 --> 13:38.440
Aaand we're here.

13:39.140 --> 13:42.010
Huh? Is it closed today?

13:42.510 --> 13:44.150
No, it's more like...

13:45.980 --> 13:48.750
The amusement park's
gone out of business.

13:48.750 --> 13:49.140
Huh?

13:49.590 --> 13:52.820
There's no mistaking it.
Even the haunted house is falling apart.

13:56.520 --> 13:58.060
No way...

13:58.060 --> 14:01.570
Ahh, that's too bad.  I really
wanted to show it to you,

14:02.230 --> 14:05.070
because you've
seemed depressed lately.

14:05.670 --> 14:09.530
Huh? Really?
I'm not depressed at all.

14:09.870 --> 14:16.080
Yeah, you look cheerful now,
but it seems like you're putting up a front.

14:16.080 --> 14:18.320
Is something bothering you?

14:19.120 --> 14:20.380
N-no, no... Nothing...

14:20.890 --> 14:21.450
Really?

14:22.220 --> 14:27.430
Really. I had so much fun looking for
the snake and riding bikes with you.

14:27.430 --> 14:30.190
I'm really enjoying myself!
Couldn't be better!

14:30.190 --> 14:31.560
Ah, that's good.

14:33.260 --> 14:35.770
You're a good man, Mimura...

14:39.800 --> 14:41.910
Now do you understand, Waffle?

14:41.910 --> 14:45.240
The park went under, so it's
not running anymore.

14:45.240 --> 14:47.280
Just give it up.

14:47.280 --> 14:51.620
No way! I had my heart set on playing
at this amusement park!

14:56.350 --> 14:58.540
Okay, time for some magic.

14:58.860 --> 15:01.090
Hey, let's go take a look!

15:01.090 --> 15:01.860
Huh?

15:01.860 --> 15:04.730
Come on! Let's go!
We did come all this way!

15:04.730 --> 15:05.560
But–

15:05.560 --> 15:07.270
It's fine! Let's just go take a look!

15:07.270 --> 15:08.930
Hey, Kato!

15:10.770 --> 15:14.870
Huh, Kato? Hey, Kato?!

15:16.740 --> 15:22.080
This is a large-scale spell, and
it might not last too long, but...

15:22.550 --> 15:25.280
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

15:31.420 --> 15:32.660
Wand!

15:46.370 --> 15:49.070
Activate the amusement park!

16:09.890 --> 16:11.960
Hey! Let's ride this one.

16:11.960 --> 16:14.270
Hey Kato, where were you?

16:14.270 --> 16:15.670
C'mon! Let's go!

16:15.670 --> 16:16.100
Hey!

16:20.040 --> 16:23.610
I don't believe it... I don't believe
it, but it's definitely moving!

16:24.840 --> 16:27.540
C'mon... Ready... GO!

16:30.280 --> 16:33.610
I dunno what's going on here
but it sure is fun! Yahoo!

16:37.960 --> 16:41.990
Why the heck is Chocolat using
magic for something like this?

16:41.990 --> 16:44.100
How come she gets to have all the fun?

16:44.100 --> 16:49.770
Waffle-sama, doesn't it look like Chocolat
is having a lot of fun with this boy?

16:49.770 --> 16:52.770
If Chocolat keeps playing with this boy...

16:52.770 --> 16:55.610
then Houx-sama will be all yours!

16:55.610 --> 16:58.110
I see! You're so smart, Nana!

16:58.110 --> 17:01.580
Then let's start up
even more of the rides!

17:01.580 --> 17:03.610
I will do as you say.

17:06.480 --> 17:09.150
I'm so glad Mimura's enjoying this.

17:13.890 --> 17:14.760
Huh?

17:14.760 --> 17:15.650
What the-?

17:16.090 --> 17:17.530
We're flying in the sky!

17:17.530 --> 17:19.630
Unreal, it's flying!

17:19.630 --> 17:21.890
It's powered up even more since
the last time I rode it!

17:22.530 --> 17:26.040
Wha's happening here?
I didn't use this much magic.

17:29.140 --> 17:31.040
Waffle and Saule!?

17:31.040 --> 17:32.630
What's going on?

17:32.630 --> 17:36.130
This must be another one
of Waffle's pranks.

17:36.130 --> 17:38.650
Whoa! This is amazing!

17:38.650 --> 17:42.650
But it's fine. Mimura's having fun.

17:46.160 --> 17:47.220
So fun!

17:57.970 --> 18:00.170
Being with Mimura is really fun!

18:00.170 --> 18:05.730
If only I'd fallen for someone
like him instead of Pierre...

18:17.760 --> 18:20.220
Wow! These can fly too!

18:24.060 --> 18:27.300
Yay! Saule, fly higher! Higher!

18:27.300 --> 18:29.430
Yes, Princess, whatever you say.

18:32.800 --> 18:35.290
This amusement park is amazing!

18:35.290 --> 18:37.470
It's fun, isn't it?

18:40.800 --> 18:42.800
Waaah! Everything's spinning!

18:43.080 --> 18:45.540
I'm getting dizzy!

18:46.350 --> 18:48.550
It's your magic that did it.

19:15.710 --> 19:19.280
Huh? What am I doing sleeping here?

19:19.720 --> 19:23.260
Remember? We rode our bikes
here, but the park was closed...

19:23.620 --> 19:24.890
Oh, I'm sorry!

19:24.890 --> 19:28.320
Don't sweat it, riding the
bike was a blast too!

19:29.290 --> 19:32.600
Y'know, I felt like I
was dreaming just now...

19:32.600 --> 19:38.770
It was a crazy-fun dream where I rode
rollercoasters and horses through the sky!

19:39.280 --> 19:40.440
Hey, Kato!

19:40.440 --> 19:41.030
Huh?

19:41.030 --> 19:44.810
I'll find another
haunted house we can go to.

19:44.810 --> 19:46.540
A mega-scary one!

19:46.540 --> 19:48.040
Yeah!

19:51.580 --> 19:54.550
A green heart...
It represents "friendship."

19:56.350 --> 20:00.120
I love being with Mimura,
and we have lots of fun together...

20:00.890 --> 20:03.060
but I'm not in love with him.

20:15.810 --> 20:20.220
Mimura's a dear friend,
with a beautiful heart.

20:20.220 --> 20:22.310
That's why I won't take it.
That way, he'll never change.

20:31.320 --> 20:34.330
Thanks for taking me out, Saule!

20:34.330 --> 20:35.960
I had a great time!

20:35.960 --> 20:40.760
You may be full of energy
but I'm drained. Later.

20:41.430 --> 20:42.830
Bye bye!

20:42.830 --> 20:45.290
Let us return home as well, Waffle-sama.

20:45.290 --> 20:51.140
I'm exhausted from doing large-scale
magic for the first time in ages.

20:51.140 --> 20:52.510
Thank you, Nana!

20:53.510 --> 20:57.480
Awww, I wanna play at the
amusement park again.

20:57.480 --> 21:00.220
Alone with Houx-sama, if I can.

21:00.220 --> 21:03.570
Saule's cool and sweet,
and I like him...

21:03.570 --> 21:07.120
but Houx-sama's the one I love!

21:07.790 --> 21:11.360
Here, Chocolat-chan.
It's hot chocolate.

21:11.360 --> 21:13.500
Wow, thank you!

21:13.500 --> 21:15.700
Did you have fun
at the amusement park?

21:15.700 --> 21:16.730
Yeah!

21:19.440 --> 21:21.010
It's delicious!

21:21.010 --> 21:26.340
Say Vanilla, why does friendship
feel so much happier than love?

21:29.850 --> 21:34.180
Vanilla, when I think about Pierre...

21:34.180 --> 21:37.350
my heart tingles and aches.

21:38.420 --> 21:39.890
Chocolat-chan...

21:39.890 --> 21:44.090
I've got no choice but to just
forget about jerks like him!

21:46.460 --> 21:49.930
So tasty! I love your
hot chocolate, Vanilla!

21:51.740 --> 21:52.940
Another cup!

21:52.940 --> 21:54.540
Okay, okay, just a moment.

21:58.010 --> 22:00.340
I'm sorry to worry you, Vanilla...

22:00.340 --> 22:02.880
But I'll be fine.

22:03.980 --> 22:07.120
Thanks to you and Mimura...

22:07.120 --> 22:10.920
I'm sure I'll be able
to forget about Pierre.

22:23.610 --> 22:26.110
That girl is good and this girl is good too

22:26.110 --> 22:27.760
It's so very hard to choose

22:28.780 --> 22:31.450
That guy is bad and this guy is bad

22:31.450 --> 22:33.000
Jealousy will drive them mad

22:36.710 --> 22:39.370
Dresses are nice, ribbons are nice too

22:39.370 --> 22:40.960
Blue jeans just won't do!

22:42.040 --> 22:44.670
How about a kiss, what about tomorrow?

22:44.670 --> 22:46.380
